      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<h1>Plant the Shield</h1><p><em>The shield’s rim bites into the earth beside the tomb.</em></p><h2>Rules</h2><p><strong>ID:</strong> monster-barrow-guard-plant-the-shield</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Maneuver</p><p>Gain Stability 2 while on solid ground until its next turn; highest source only. This does not activate Shield Hunker.</p><p><strong>Limits:</strong> Costs its Maneuver; no extra action is granted.</p>"
      },
